    <briefdescription>
<para>Records and serialises a sequence of workload events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures column access observations and the total query count so that the same workload can be replayed through the index advisor later.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: all public methods are thread-safe.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_workload_capture_1ab19cb7dc4d508072fea82b5f751c64b8" kindref="member">WorkloadCapture</ref><sp/>capture;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>During<sp/>normal<sp/>query<sp/>execution:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">capture.recordQuery();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">capture.recordEvent({</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;users&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;email&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>IndexRecommender::AccessType::FILTER,<sp/>0.01});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Persist:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1a05f3ebcfd8adc466a47cf4dc737e124e" kindref="member">json</ref><sp/>j<sp/>=<sp/>capture.toJSON();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Load<sp/>later:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>loaded<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_workload_capture_1a27c518f53cd01160eacede0bfaf45b8e" kindref="member">WorkloadCapture::fromJSON</ref>(j);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
